[Poke:Infinite Lives]
<div>
  <code>POKE 44641,0</code>
</div>

Removes the instruction which would otherwise decrease the lives byte at #N$FEE4.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#N$AE5E</td>
      <td class="instruction">LD #REGa,(#N$FEE4)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#N$AE61</td>
      <td class="instruction">DEC #REGa</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#N$AE62</td>
      <td class="instruction">LD (#N$FEE4),#REGa</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
